<table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Hook</th><th scope="col" class="num">Runs</th><th scope="col" class="num">p50</th><th scope="col" class="num">p95</th><th scope="col" class="num">Max</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>guard-read</td><td class="num">1,500</td><td class="num">3.20 ms</td><td class="num">9.80 ms</td><td class="num">41.0 ms</td></tr><tr><td>route <strong class="warn">p95 above budget</strong></td><td class="num">300</td><td class="num">12.0 ms</td><td class="num">58.5 ms</td><td class="num">120.0 ms</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="note">Trade-off: hooks added 4.32 s in total, and in the same period saved about $222.85 and 1,234,567 tokens <span class="est" title="Estimate: derived from sizes or projections, not measured">estimate</span>. Process start-up adds about 6.50 ms per hook call <span class="est" title="Estimate: derived from sizes or projections, not measured">estimate</span> (from <code>doctor --bench</code>).</p></section><section id="audit" aria-labelledby="audit-heading"><h2 id="audit-heading">Audit <span class="est" title="Estimate: derived from sizes or projections, not measured">estimate</span></h2><h3>Heaviest fixed-context items</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Kind</th><th scope="col">Origin</th><th scope="col" class="num">Tokens <span class="est" title="Estimate: derived from sizes or projections, not measured">estimate</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CLAUDE.md</td><td>memory</td><td>user</td><td class="num">4,200</td></tr><tr><td>skills/deploy</td><td>skill</td><td>project billing</td><td class="num">1,900</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="note">Weight is characters / 4, an estimate.</p><h3>Unused MCP servers</h3><p class="note">No tool call in the last 30 days:</p><ul><li><code>figma</code></li><li><code>postgres</code></li></ul></section><section id="proxy-routing" aria-labelledby="proxy-routing-heading"><h2 id="proxy-routing-heading">Model routing (proxy) <span class="est" title="Estimate: derived from sizes or projections, not measured">estimate</span></h2><p class="note">120 messages were measured by the proxy; 14 are known only from the transcripts (made while the proxy was off).</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Asked for</th><th scope="col">Answered by</th><th scope="col" class="num">Messages</th><th scope="col" class="num">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>claude-sonnet-4</td><td>claude-haiku-4 <strong>rewritten</strong></td><td class="num">40</td><td class="num">$1.50</td></tr><tr><td>claude-opus-4</td><td>claude-opus-4</td><td class="num">80</td><td class="num">$9.00</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Routing decisions</th><th scope="col" class="num">Count</th><th scope="col" class="num">Saving <span class="est" title="Estimate: derived from sizes or projections, not measured">estimate</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Applied (model changed)</td><td class="num">30</td><td class="num">$4.25</td></tr><tr><td>Observed (would have changed)</td><td class="num">10</td><td class="num">$1.50</td></tr><tr><td>Kept as asked</td><td class="num">5</td><td class="num">&ndash;</td></tr><tr><td>Fell back to the original</td><td class="num">1</td><td class="num">&ndash;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="note">Suggestion waiting: The last 3 prompts were simple; sonnet would have done. <code>tokred suggest</code> shows the evidence.</p></section><section id="proxy-overhead" aria-labelledby="proxy-overhead-heading"><h2 id="proxy-overhead-heading">Proxy overhead</h2><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 640.0 76.0" role="img" aria-labelledby="proxy-overhead-chart-title"><title id="proxy-overhead-chart-title">Time added by the proxy: p50, p95 and maximum against the budget</title><line class="ref" x1="544.0" y1="18.0" x2="544.0" y2="72.0"/><text class="tick" x="544.0" y="12.0" text-anchor="middle">10.0 ms budget</text><text class="label" x="142.0" y="32.0" text-anchor="end">Proxy</text><rect class="bar s2" x="150.0" y="18.0" width="15.8" height="12.0" tabindex="0" data-tip="Proxy: p50 0.40 ms"/><text class="val" x="171.8" y="28.0">p50 0.40 ms</text><rect class="bar s1" x="150.0" y="32.0" width="47.3" height="12.0" tabindex="0" data-tip="Proxy: p95 1.20 ms"/><text class="val" x="203.3" y="42.0">p95 1.20 ms</text><rect class="bar s4" x="150.0" y="46.0" width="137.9" height="12.0" tabindex="0" data-tip="Proxy: max 3.50 ms"/><text class="val" x="293.9" y="56.0">max 3.50 ms</text></svg><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="num">Requests</th><th scope="col" class="num">p50</th><th scope="col" class="num">p95</th><th scope="col" class="num">p99</th><th scope="col" class="num">Max</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="num">150</td><td class="num">0.40 ms</td><td class="num">1.20 ms</td><td class="num">2.00 ms</td><td class="num">3.50 ms</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="note">p95 is within the 10.0 ms budget. This is the time the proxy spent before forwarding each request.</p></section><section id="proxy-cache" aria-labelledby="proxy-cache-heading"><h2 id="proxy-cache-heading">Cache misses by cause</h2><svg class="chart" viewBox="0 0 640.0 72.0" role="img" aria-labelledby="proxy-cache-causes-title"><title id="proxy-cache-causes-title">Main-loop prompt-cache misses per likely cause</title><text class="label" x="142.0" y="32.0" text-anchor="end">ttl_expired</text><rect class="bar s4" x="150.0" y="18.0" width="236.4" height="12.0" tabindex="0" data-tip="ttl_expired: misses 6"/><text class="val" x="392.4" y="28.0">6</text><text class="label" x="142.0" y="56.0" text-anchor="end">tools_changed</text><rect class="bar s4" x="150.0" y="42.0" width="78.8" height="12.0" tabindex="0" data-tip="tools_changed: misses 2"/><text class="val" x="234.8" y="52.0">2</text></svg><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Cause</th><th scope="col" class="num">Misses</th><th scope="c